      "id": "claim_e141deba2f1e4ba0894ebb2a18613af2",
      "statement": "ecshopx-openapi is a standalone Maven module whose only Shopex dependency is ecshopx-common; it cannot reach business Bundles directly. All domain behavior is injected through the Openapi*Port interfaces declared in ecshopx-common/openapi/ and implemented in the owning Bundles' own openapi/ packages (dependency inversion), with the single exception of OpenapiDeveloperLookupPort, which is implemented inside ecshopx-openapi itself against the module's own openapi_developer table.",
