      "id": "claim_1332f89f7889456d9878eb70ac5be068",
      "statement": "OpenapiPathPatterns is the single source of truth for the path split: PUBLIC_PREFIX /api/openapi vs INTERNAL_PREFIX /api/openapi/internal. isInternalPath(uri) is a startsWith on the internal prefix, and isPublicOpenapiPath(uri) is startsWith on the public prefix AND not internal — simple predicates with no deeper path parsing.",
