    {
      "id": "claim_fb2cff4128cf498ca7d2a8360276d12c",
      "statement": "Public-path auth verification order in OpenapiAuthInterceptor: required version/timestamp/app_key (E4001 VALIDATION_MISSING_PARAMS) → debug bypass → timestamp within a 600-second tolerance (E4002 VALIDATION_TIMESTAMP_ERROR) → sign present (E4004 SIGN_ERROR) → app_key resolves via OpenapiDeveloperLookupPort (E4003 VALIDATION_APPKEY_ERROR) → MD5 sign match (E4004) → set auth company_id via OpenapiAuthAttributes and pass. Every auth failure writes an HTTP 200 OpenapiEnvelope fail body and returns false to stop the chain.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ecshopx-openapi/src/main/java/cn/shopex/ecshopx/openapi/web/OpenapiAuthInterceptor.java#L71-L116",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e0af4bba3adcac7c778b2c6bf4aee6b8c2adc764ebd0d90e5fb025e7ef95d4ea:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_15f5bef4b5724affbc5c6fbe907efeaa",
      "statement": "OpenapiSignSupport (ecshopx-common) is a byte-for-byte reimplementation of PHP OpenapiCheck gen_sign/assemble: keys sorted lexicographically, nulls skipped, booleans as 1/0, nested Maps assembled recursively and Iterables element-by-element, and the signature is MD5(token + assemble(params) + token) rendered as 32-char uppercase hex, compared over the params map with the sign key removed.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://ecshopx-common/src/main/java/cn/shopex/ecshopx/common/openapi/OpenapiSignSupport.java",
          "version": "repo-file-v1:sha256:ad61b65ee8e4ba3b038baeea5664bdd16ee1bcb99c63dfb75bb80bdb412d5db9"
