    {
      "id": "claim_ba5762a1879e4e8eb99cf7c6eab46528",
      "statement": "OpenapiGatewayController maps /api/openapi and /api/openapi/{method} for GET/POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE/HEAD/OPTIONS and delegates to OpenapiGatewayDispatchService.dispatch, which: resolves the method (parameter first, path suffix second; missing → E4005 \"method 不存在\"), normalizes the version and uppercases the HTTP verb, resolves the forward path via OpenapiHandlerForwardRegistry (no entry → E4005 \"API 方法不存在\"), and forwards via RequestDispatcher. A registered path with no matching @RequestMapping throws OpenapiNotImplementedException, rendered as E0001 with {method, version} in data — the explicit \"not yet migrated from PHP\" signal.",
      "evidence": [
