    {
      "id": "claim_039a1a5f0a004ac091dbb88e27ae69ca",
      "statement": "The openapi_developer table holds one row per company_id with inbound app_key/app_secret plus outbound external_base_uri/external_app_key/external_app_secret. OpenapiDeveloperLookupPortImpl implements the common OpenapiDeveloperLookupPort used by the auth interceptor: findByAppKey selects LIMIT 1 by trimmed app_key and returns OpenapiDeveloperCredentials(companyId, appSecret), or empty when the row, company id, or secret is missing — which the interceptor turns into E4003.",
