      "statement": "MarketingCenterOpenApiSignedFormClient (ecshopx-third-party) is the outbound mirror of the gateway: it reads the external_* columns of the same openapi_developer row, builds {data, timestamp, app_key, version: \"1.0\", method}, computes sign = uppercase MD5(appSecret + assemble + appSecret) over the sorted keys, and form-POSTs to {external_base_uri}/api/openapi. Every marketing-center push processor goes through it and failures degrade to an empty map rather than an exception.",
